Modified by ogadra: send a semantic notification's sound only to the foreground client shell, or to the latest active one when the foreground client is not a shell, and send the others the same notification without it, so attaching several windows to one session plays each sound once. Applied to herdr v0.9.5 (Apache-2.0).

